# SFCC Mid Level Developer
Remote · Full-time
Apply
→
Responsibilities
## Your *responsibilities*
* Develop and maintain Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC/B2C Commerce) storefronts;
* Build and customise SFCC cartridges following platform best practices;
* Integrate third-party services and APIs into the SFCC platform;
* Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver eCommerce solutions;
* Participate in code reviews and uphold code quality standards;
* Troubleshoot, debug and resolve platform issues in a timely manner.
Skills & experience
## *Skills* & *experience*
* 2+ years of hands-on experience with Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC / B2C Commerce);
* Proficiency in SFCC cartridge development and ISML templating;
* Strong knowledge of JavaScript and familiarity with Node.js;
* Experience with the Salesforce Commerce Cloud Script API;
* Experience integrating RESTful APIs and third-party services;
* Knowledge of Agile methodologies such as Scrum or Kanban;
* Care about code quality and performance;
* Self-driven with the ability to work independently;
* Degree in Computer Engineering or similar;
* Fluent in English.
Benefits
## Main *benefits*
* Competitive salary package;
* Career development, build skills around open and best-of-breed technologies;
* Possibility of participation in international and multicultural projects;
* Health Insurance;
* Happy, fun and self-driven team;
* Drinks and snacks;
* MacBook Pro or similar;
* Suitable training (certifications included);
* Flexible working options - remote work.
